# .mailmap — canonical commit-author display for Unity AI Lab
#
# Maps historical commit emails to canonical lab identities. Git tooling
# (log, shortlog, blame) and Forgejo's web UI all respect this file when
# displaying commit authorship — no actual history rewrite needed.
#
# Format: Proper Name <canonical@email> <commit@email>
# See `git help mailmap` for full syntax.

